<!doctype html>
<!--
  The Wild Fields.

  **Where a plant goes when it is released**, since 1 October 2026. Until then
  this page said `notYet` and described something else — a seed set down to
  wait for another, which is The Winds (docs/PHASES.md) and the opposite of
  release — while the app's Release mark deleted the plant and sent it
  nowhere. Marcus released a plant believing it went somewhere, and decided
  that day to build the place it was going.

  **The opposite of the ten areas, and drawn like it** (docs/WEB-GARDENS.md
  §*The Wild Fields*). Nobody arranges it: a released plant stands where its
  own seed puts it. It is one ground with no edge rather than plots, walked by
  dragging rather than by a map, and the window opens over somewhere a plant
  stands rather than over a corner. No names, no senders, no dates — the plot
  service keeps none (`Server/.api/WildStore.php`) — and no lamps: it is lit by
  the Milky Way and by fireflies that are simply there, which is why this page
  is night whatever the hour.

  **The plants are grown here, in the browser**, from the same SeedCore that
  grows them on the phone, as on every area page; the field and its night are
  `wildfields.js`, the page is `wildpage.js`.

  `noindex`, for the reason `/g` gives. Static, like the rest: no analytics,
  no font CDN, no third-party anything.
-->
<!-- `data-module` is stamped by index.php: the module's address with this
     build's mark on it, so a new one is a new address. -->
<html lang="en" data-module="PG_MODULE">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>Peace Garden — the Wild Fields</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Where a plant goes when it is released: a field nobody arranges, lit by the Milky Way and by fireflies." />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site.css" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/icon-180.png" />
  </head>

  <body class="night">
    <!-- The sky, behind everything, with the Milky Way in it: the light the
         field is lit by. -->
    <div class="walk" aria-hidden="true">
      <canvas id="sky"></canvas>
      <div class="pool"></div>
    </div>

    <main class="page walk-page" id="page">
      <!--
        The bar. On every page of the site. The garden glyph goes to the map
        of the ten areas, which is where the Wild Fields are reached from: a
        named place off the map, not a cell on it (docs/PHASES.md).
      -->
      <header class="masthead bar">
        <a class="bar__home" href="/">
          <img class="mark" src="/assets/icon.svg" alt="" width="44" height="44" />
          <span class="wordmark">Peace Garden</span>
        </a>
        <span class="bar__ways">
          <a class="bar-glyph" href="/garden" data-s-label="gardenTitle"><svg class="bar-glyph__mark" viewBox="0 0 15 15" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M 4.674 4.059 C 3.796 1.407, 6.716 1.407, 5.838 4.059 C 8.089 2.405, 8.991 5.181, 6.198 5.166 C 8.467 6.795, 6.105 8.512, 5.256 5.850 C 4.407 8.512, 2.045 6.795, 4.314 5.166 C 1.521 5.181, 2.423 2.405, 4.674 4.059 Z M 5.784 14.100 C 5.652 10.932, 5.124 9.612, 5.256 7.500 M 10.140 14.100 C 9.678 10.932, 9.150 8.556, 8.622 6.180 M 10.140 14.100 C 10.338 10.404, 10.470 6.972, 10.338 3.540 M 10.140 14.100 C 10.800 10.932, 11.658 8.820, 12.318 6.972 M 4.200 14.100 L 11.328 14.100" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" /></svg></a>
          <a class="bar-glyph" href="/meanings" data-s-label="meaningsTitle"><svg class="bar-glyph__mark" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M10 5.2C8.2 3.9 5.4 3.5 2.75 3.9V15.4C5.4 15 8.2 15.4 10 16.7C11.8 15.4 14.6 15 17.25 15.4V3.9C14.6 3.5 11.8 3.9 10 5.2ZM10 5.2V16.7" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" /></svg></a>
          <label class="bar-language">
            <span class="visually-hidden" id="language-label"></span>
            <svg class="bar-language__mark" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 10a7 7 0 1 0 14 0a7 7 0 1 0 -14 0M10 3C7.4 5.3 7.4 14.7 10 17M10 3C12.6 5.3 12.6 14.7 10 17M3 10H17M4.2 6.2H15.8M4.2 13.8H15.8" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" /></svg>
            <span class="chooser__field">
              <select id="language" class="chooser__select"></select>
              <svg class="chooser__mark" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 6.5 L8 10.5 L12 6.5" /></svg>
            </span>
          </label>
        </span>
      </header>

      <!--
        The field, and the fireflies over it. Two canvases in one band: the
        field is drawn when the window moves and the fireflies thirty times a
        second, so they are not one drawing. The band is masked so the field
        thins into the night at every side rather than stopping at the edge of
        a rectangle — the field has no edge, and neither does its picture. See
        site.css §The Wild Fields.
      -->
      <div class="wild-band">
        <canvas class="walk-stage" id="stage" aria-label="The Wild Fields"></canvas>
        <canvas class="wild-flies" id="flies" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      </div>

      <div class="area-panels">
        <section class="area-panel area-panel--words">
          <h1 class="heading" data-s="wildTitle"></h1>
          <p class="body walk-about" data-s="wildBody"></p>
          <!-- One line, and only when there is something to say. -->
          <p class="label walk-note" id="note" role="status" hidden></p>
        </section>
        <div class="area-panel area-panel--ways walk-ways">
          <!-- The pad, the same as every area's (`movepad.js`), roaming. -->
          <nav class="walk-keys" id="keys" role="group" hidden></nav>
        </div>
      </div>

      <footer class="foot bar-foot">
        <a class="bar-foot__link" href="/privacy" data-s="privacyTitle"></a>
      </footer>
    </main>

    <script type="module" src="/assets/js/plain.js"></script>
    <script type="module" src="/assets/js/wildpage.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
